  m_text: 'In this game you have to destroy enemy shells on your fighter. Show your
    courage and reaction thanks to your aviation skills! You will lose if a projectile
    of the same color as the line it is on passes your defense, be very careful!



    Control
    is done with your finger, swiping left and right on the screen will help the
    plane move, and tapping the screen will allow the plane to shoot bullets.



    Good
    luck in the game!'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 79e1fbd213da4e44dbf428f982562222, type: 2}
